 da: angular width (degrees), \n#      v: median velocity (km/s)\n#     dv: variation (1 sigma) of velocity over the width of the CME\n#   minv: lowest velocity detected within the CME\n#   maxv: highest velocity detected within the CME\n#  halo?: II if da>90, III if da>180, IV if da>270, indicating potential halo/partial halo CME\n# \n  </PRE>\n <td valign='top'>\n  <PRE>\n# CME |          t0    | dt0| pa | da |  v  |  dv | minv| maxv| halo?\n  <a href=\"CME0022/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0022</a>|2026/10/06 07:12| 03 | 346| 130| 0375| 0105| 0217| 0659|  II\n  <a href=\"CME0021/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0021</a>|2026/10/06 00:36| 02 | 296| 014| 0232| 0100| 0160| 0408|    \n  <a href=\"CME0020/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0020</a>|2026/10/05 23:24| 01 | 250| 030| 0290| 0030| 0236| 0353|    \n  <a href=\"CME0019/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0019</a>|2026/10/05 22:12| 01 | 056| 018| 0184| 0034| 0114| 0235|    \n  <a href=\"CME0018/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0018</a>|2026/10/05 21:24| 07 | 309| 056| 0188| 0029| 0122| 0236|    \n  <a href=\"CME0017/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0017</a>|2026/10/05 09:36| 03 | 111| 020| 051"
